# Kevin sets these in the Vercel dashboard, never in a file.

# ── Owner panel (/admin) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The panel works with none of these set: it falls back to a demo PIN (the
# shop phone's last four) and an in-memory store, and says so on its own
# screens. Before the panel carries real edits:
#   PANEL_PIN=           # Susan's PIN, 4 to 12 digits, told to her by phone
#   PANEL_SECRET=        # any long random string; signs the login cookie
#   DATABASE_URL=        # arrives by itself: Vercel > Storage > Create
#                        # Database > Neon (free). Any *_DATABASE_URL /
#                        # *_POSTGRES_URL spelling the integration injects
#                        # is picked up too (lib/panel/store.ts).

# ── Store launch (not wired yet) ────────────────────────────────────────
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=   # Stripe hosted checkout
#   INQUIRY_TO=          # inbox for contact + free sample forms
